+** fallback SDK (JSONL), implemented in antithesis/antithesis_fallback.c, and are
+** used by Antithesis to snapshot and branch from those states during testing.
+**
+** They compile to nothing unless the build defines SQLITE_ENABLE_ANTITHESIS, so
+** an ordinary SQLite build is completely unaffected.
